# ==============================================================================
# Corpora and everything derived from them. All rebuildable, none belongs in git.
# This is ~3.6 GB: dataset_v5 alone is 904 MB and speech_corpus is 1.2 GB.
# ==============================================================================
*.npz
*.npy
dataset/
dataset_*/
noise_bank/
speech_corpus/
corpus_cache/
cache/
logs/
.kaggle-outputs/
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg

# The noise-bank inventory is 247 KB of CSV naming every clip, its class and its
# duration. The audio is 0.5 GB, the index is what makes stratified sampling
# reproducible, so the index is tracked and the clips it points at are not.
noise_bank_v2/*
!noise_bank_v2/index.csv

# ==============================================================================
# Credentials. The notebook reads its Kaggle key from the environment; kaggle.json
# and the session transcript dumps are local only.
# ==============================================================================
session-ses_*.md
kaggle.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*_rsa
credentials.json

# ==============================================================================
# Model weights: the experiments are reproducible from the code, so only the
# checkpoints the documentation actually references are tracked.
#
# Tracked as of 2026-09-27: the iteration chain that produced the new production
# model. Each is 84,865 params (82.9 KB INT8) unless noted, so the whole set is
# ~3 MB -- cheap enough to keep every step, which matters because the winning
# recipe (mine the failure mode, fine-tune, re-measure on real audio) is only
# reproducible from the intermediate checkpoints.
# ==============================================================================
*.flax
!best_v3_50k.flax
!best_50k_kws_model.flax
!best_v6_compact24k.flax
!best_v7_full108k.flax
!best_v8_speech_mined.flax
!best_v8_production.flax
!best_v9_fullbank.flax
!best_v10_remined.flax
!best_v11_soundscape_mined.flax
!best_v12_hardpos.flax
!best_v13_lowsnr.flax

